        {
          "id": "b0623738-376e-3a94-a29a-327988959dd5",
          "content": {
            "id": "b0623738-376e-3a94-a29a-327988959dd5",
            "contentType": "VIDEO",
            "title": "Pfizer plans to enter GLP-1 space by 2028, CEO explains",
            "description": "<p>Pfizer (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/PFE\">PFE</a>) chairman and CEO, Albert Bourla, sits down with Yahoo Finance Executive Editor <a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/author/brian-sozzi/\">Brian Sozzi </a>to share that Pfizer will enter the obesity market by 2028 after paying $10B to acquire Metsera (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/MTSR\">MTSR</a>). The drugmaker won out over rival Novo Nordisk (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/NVO\">NVO</a>) in its bid for the company.</p>\n<p>Be sure to <a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/video/pfizer-ceo-ai-help-medicines-170431756.html\">watch the full interview</a> with Albert Bourla.</p>\n<p>For full interviews, highlights, and key insights, check out more from\u00a0<a data-i13n=\"cpos:6;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/topic/yf-invest/\">Yahoo Finance Invest</a>.</p>",
            "summary": "Pfizer (PFE) chairman and CEO, Albert Bourla, sits down with Yahoo Finance Executive Editor Brian Sozzi to share that Pfizer will enter the obesity market by 2028 after paying $10B to acquire Metsera (MTSR). The drugmaker won out over rival Novo Nordisk (NVO) in its bid for the company. Be sure to watch the full interview with Albert Bourla. For full interviews, highlights, and key insights, check out more from&nbsp;Yahoo Finance Invest.",
